{"id":"klappe","lemma":"Klappe","pos":"noun","rank":667,"glosses":["any technical piece of equipment bound in front of a beast to obstruct its movement or vision, as a muzzle or twitch or barnacle (tendentially a muzzle, while a twitch preferredly bears the form Kluppe or Knuppe)","gob, mouth","cottage, tea room (public toilet or similar place used by men seeking sex with other men, for cottaging)"],"ipa":"/ˈklapə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6c/De-at-Klappe.ogg/De-at-Klappe.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Klappe","plural":"Klappen"},"formAudio":{"Klappen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-klappen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Er hat eine große Klappe.","en":"He has a big mouth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392097","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},null]},{"text":"Kannst du bitte die Klappe halten?","en":"Can you please shut up?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to hold"}]},{"text":"Ich halte jetzt die Klappe.","en":"I'll shut up now.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hold","l":"halten"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich werde meine Klappe halten.","en":"I'll keep my mouth shut.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to hold"}]},{"text":"Halt deine große Klappe!","en":"Shut your big mouth.","words":[{"g":"Indicating that…"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},null]}]}